	(text_box "U2 is a logical 16-pin carrier, not a connector. Footprint is intentionally unset.\nMMC5983MA pin map (Rev A): 1 SCL, 2 VDD, 3 NC, 4 CS=VDDIO, 5 SDO NC, 6-8 NC, 9 GND, 10 CAP, 11 GND, 12 NC, 13 VDDIO, 14 NC, 15 INT NC/polled, 16 SDA."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 60.96 112.395 0.0000)
		(size 72.39 17.78)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.254)
			(type solid)
